    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.3.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ut autem in his re­ bus quævis luminum subtilitas, nullo unquam lau­ dationis titulamento, credulitatem mentis tuæ at­ trahat in consensu,",
