    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "invenes homines ad honoris tui cumulum 289 augmentando minue­ re, hanc vero solam minuendo plus addere. Quantum ergo magnus es ( siCUli an Salomon ) tantum te humilia.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quia etcuin multos gubernaveris, non est tamen per­ fectio, si hoc, quod majus est, tu solus restiteris, quem gubernare non possis.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tunc enim vere aliis præibis. cum prius praevenis tibi. Nee enim mas nunc ego, sed quam maxime bonis haec loquor.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam si ad magisterium Dei respicias , non solum peccatori, sed sanctis data praecepta sunt.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dicitur et illis vernum Veritatis, non tamen ut fiaut boni, quod suni, sed ne fiaut mali, quod non sunt.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Credo autem quia bonis plus hoc quod purum, quod sincerum est, placeat.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam Deus noster non tantum dulcibus adorantium se precibus quantum innocenti a et simplicitate placatur, plus illis aurem inclinans qui sinceram puramque ei mentem offerunt, quam qui suavia orationum intule­ rint blandimenta.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non enim ad alium mihi de vana gloria aut superbia visum est loqui, nisi ad te quicun­ que prior es aliis;",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "qui etsi non recipias, tamen omnes hæc ingerunt, omnes blandiuntur, omnes extollunt, nemo ex illis id offerens quod ita dulce sit, ut tamen a periculo longe sii.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.4.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.4.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nec enim miror omnibus esse in promptu quia laudare potentem. sicut nec labor, ita nec timor est.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "4. Tibi igitur me oportuit hæc humilitatis instru­ menta porrigere, tibi gubernacui, qu'uvis et ipsa habeas, etiam hoc superfluum addere moderamen.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quia ibi semper elationis fortior ventus est, ubi bono.. ris fortior altitudo.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cupio ergo te ante oculos Dei, quibus nuda est abyssus humanæ conscientiæ, humili corde semper incedere, quia scriptum est :",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Super quem (inquit Dominus) requiescet Spiritus meus, niti super humilem, et trementem verba mea?",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cupio te om­ nia man lata Curisti servare, et cula illa operibus bo­ nis adimpleas, illud quo'i ipsis apostolis dictum est recordari.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ait enim iliis : Et cum hæc omnia feceritis quæ mando vobis, dicte quia servi mutiles fuimus, quæ debuimus facere fecimus; id est, non ex dono tanquam liber, sed ex debito tanquam servi.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nullus enim quam­ vis perfectus in omnibus vir, ita aliquando hæc præoc­ cupavit, quæ Deo sunt placita, ut prius aliquid illi fenerans, non debit r fuerit, sed exactor.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quis enim aliquid habet, quod ab illo non datum est? Aut quis, sicut Apostolus ait, prior dedit illi, et retribuetur ei?",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.5.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.5.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quoniam omnia ex ipso, et per ipsum, et in ipso, ipse gloria in sæcuta. Amen.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "5. Ecce hæc est vera illa et Christiana humilitas. In hac eos quibus praesides optime gubernabis.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In hac victoriam ex omui vitio poteris promereri, Deo hoc, quod viceris, tribuendo, non tibi.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam quod aliquo­ ties patientia victa vitia iterum vires accipiunt, nihil aliud est, mihi crede, nisi quia non dicimus Deo, quod belligerator ille David, bella Domini bellans :",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In te (inquit) inimicos nostros ventilavimus., et in nomine tuo spernimus insurgentes in nos.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et iterum : Quia non virtute sua pote s est vir, Dominus infirmum facit ad­ versarium ejus.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed forte respondetur mihi : Ergo et, Deo non agimus gratias, non referimus laudes? Credo . quia agimus gratias potest fieri ; sed verbo tenus, sed in sinu ;",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "290 Deo privatim gratias agimus, nobis publice; Deo in labiis laudem tribuimus, nobis et in labiis, et in corde.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecce hoc est quod incurvatum sæpius erigit inimicum. Peccatum namque elationis nostræ robur illius.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sola ergo humilitas cordis est quæ se infirmam dicendo omnia potest, quae totum quod boni est obtinet;",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Deo hoc semper applicando, non sibi; in qua si quis ascenderit, non habet unde cadat.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Omnes aliæ virtutes ad perfectionem suam per ex­ celsa quædam nos et ardua poterunt provocare, haec sola in plano est;",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et quamvis humilior aliis videatur, cœlo tamen est altior, quia in regno ejus hominem non ascendendo, sed descendendo, perducil.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Per hanc obtinuerunt sancti futurae beatitudinis praemia, custodientes Dominicum illud eloquium : Beati pau­ peres spiritu, quoniam ipsorum est regnum cælorum.",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.6.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.6.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Iłle est, scilicet, humilis , qui spiritu dives est. Flatu quodam elationis abundans elatus ut uter est.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.7.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.7.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "6. Sed jam quomodo ipsa virtus obtineatur, chari­ tas tua paulisper intendat.",
    "chunk_index": 67,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap#PL83.AP.7.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-isidorus/pl83_31_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL83.AP.7.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In primis si quid volueris boni operis inchoare, non hoc proposito acquirendae laudis, sed studio inchoationis faciendae bonitatis in- cipies.",
    "chunk_index": 68,
